      "statement": "Anthropic Claude prompt caching is opt-in through `cache_control`, prefix-based, defaults to a five-minute TTL, refreshes that TTL on a successful hit, and offers a higher-priced one-hour TTL; usage distinguishes ordinary input, cache creation, and cache reads.",
