      "id": "claim_61a1532874eb414692b646ebd93a20de",
      "statement": "MCP is a JSON-RPC-based protocol for an LLM client to consume tools, resources, and prompts; its stateful initialization handshake negotiates version and capabilities over a persistent bidirectional connection that can carry server-initiated notifications.",
